      look: 'The SPELLS shelf: Goodberry cast -- the card "ten berries in the hand, into the pack". Then in a game: deep16/?at=three16, THE NIGHT, Lymen takes the Oath of the Green Return; next day M, MAGIC, Lymen, GOODBERRY (always ready, a 1st-level slot): "ten berries into the pack". ITEMS: Goodberry x10 -- a hurt hero eats one, 1 HP. The next long rest\'s morning says "The goodberries have dried out." and the pack has none. In a fight, the paladin\'s MAGIC casts it too, and ITEM eats one (an action).',
