      look: 'Your "Journal mission storage looks good, little less time to read it before it goes in the journal please / remove first sound on appearance and keep the tucked away in journal sound": click Warrens Pete -- THE MISSING FIVE\'s words in the middle, with no sound; leave them, and they fly into the menu\'s JOURNAL after four and a half seconds (six before); the soft chime as the column leaves, as before. A click still sends them sooner.',
